==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|fr|contrôle}}. Further from {{der|ru|la|contra-}} + {{der|ru|la|rotula}}, from {{der|ru|la|rota}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|контро́ль}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-контроль.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|olʲ|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|контро́ль|m|adj=контро́льный}}

# [[control]]
# [[checkup]], [[check]]ing, [[inspection]], [[monitoring]], [[supervision]], [[verification]]
# [[blank test]], [[standard]]
# [[institution]] or [[organization]] that [[carry out|carries out]] such [[check]]s, [[inspection]]s or [[monitor]]ing
# [[area]] at the [[entrance]] to a [[theater]] where [[ticket]]s are [[check]]ed or [[collect]]ed
# {{lb|ru|informal}} [[ticket-collector]]s, [[inspector]]s

